Con. Or as I am to you now;
Mi. Then you'll be new again, like one that has been long out of Print,
and I am always fond of the Second Edition, Revis'd, Corrected and Amended; but be sure you take care never. to let me peruse it thro', reserve something for my Curiosity, Constant; for you know the best Books when we have studied 'em perfectly, are thrown aside, or only kept for Shew, and any trifling Novel that we never met with before, entertains us better.
